  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d98b51b72d7a71a",
      "translationZh": "我一直在尝试本地 LLM，想做点东西，让它们真正用于实际工作流程，而不只是与模型聊天。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0eac36a1044a4008",
      "translationZh": "于是就有了 Meetas，一个本地会议助手。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38630b7e4ea7e9e4",
      "translationZh": "🎙️ 录制/导入会议",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f22c35d10b661cb7",
      "translationZh": "→ 🤖 将转录文本发送给你自己的本地 LLM",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f5245daeebfce9e6",
      "translationZh": "→ 💬 提问 / 分析 / 提取任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e521002e8a57431",
      "translationZh": "→ 🔎 跨会议和文档搜索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a07322b555a6f51",
      "translationZh": "对我来说，有意思的部分是依据锚定。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "49f1de65ae676d5e",
      "translationZh": "会议分析会按摘要、决策、任务、风险和待解答问题等类别组织，但生成的论断必须关联到转录文本中的证据。问答也会返回转录文本引用和证据等级。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4111043eb6924be3",
      "translationZh": "Meetas 可以使用 Ollama，也可以使用其他兼容 OpenAI 的本地服务器，例如 llama.cpp。我目前使用的是一个 27B Q4 模型，但这套配置并不绑定某个特定模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "24e6ff84f3c5f1b0",
      "translationZh": "使用 faster-whisper / Parakeet 进行离线转录",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "531e884da174b5cf",
      "translationZh": "本地嵌入向量 + 混合搜索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "27615212def16846",
      "translationZh": "项目/文档索引",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "39e56ef1a77d485a",
      "translationZh": "跨会议总结与比较",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "44e8643204fb9ebf",
      "translationZh": "一个独立的通用聊天模式，特意设计为无法访问会议数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "17f5e57570fd2461",
      "translationZh": "而且所有内容都保留在本地，不使用云端 API，无需账号，也不收集遥测数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2baa03ff285eda44",
      "translationZh": "目前仅支持 Linux，而且仍处于开发过程中，远未完善。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c8b711d9d6b528c5",
      "translationZh": "你目前使用什么模型来生成会议摘要？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df4946fa05c844be",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/Odd-Name-1556 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
